e you will need to visit four different islands, overcome obstacles and avoid deadly traps. Compete with yourself or try to make it to the global high score list!", "short_description": "Be prepared to jump your way through some of the most intense fun available in Virtual Reality! By using a physically based movement scheme Kangaroo Dash puts you right in the action. You\u2019ll dodge cars, ride the rapids and be chased by both fish and foe - and everything is controlled by your body!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.photonforge.se/tos/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.photonforge.se/tos/", "publisher_name": "Photon Forge", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.photonforge.se/games/kangaroo-dash/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ARCADE", "EXPLORATION", "PUZZLE", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3095615314046172"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386444_1828244404127546_3455192058807975936_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o50QMt7FJp0Q7kNvwHG6ZG6&_nc_oc=AdoXyIEyYpoSkO6lfXKmUmWyDSJbKno2tNG4p3A6w8hwEzdfPy3JPf0Ljtw0Zgtnkss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ApEcRKl_75l5UMSmacYN21c_g7x7Pasu_32QkIZ4E-Q&oe=6A0C74FE"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Kangaroo Dash", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "conte